$ and $y\\mapsto 3y_iy_j-|y|^2\\delta_{ij}$ are bounded $\\lambda_3$-a.e. on that ball by $a^l$ and by $4a^2$ respectively, the integrands are dominated $\\lambda_3$-a.e. by $a^l|\\rho|$ and $4a^2|\\rho|$, which lie in $L^1$ ([[thm-integral-triangle-inequality]], [[prop-order-and-scalar-rules-for-the-nonnegative-integral]])",
