        },
        {
          "fact": "F6",
          "source": "cor-the-curl-of-a-curl-of-a-c2-field",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Let $U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^3$ be open and let $F:U\\to\\mathbb R^3$ be $C^2$. Then $\\operatorname{curl}\\operatorname{curl}F$, $\\nabla\\operatorname{div}F$ and $\\Delta F$ are all defined on $U$ and\n\n$$\\operatorname{curl}\\operatorname{curl}F=\\nabla\\operatorname{div}F-\\Delta F.$$\n\nHere $\\Delta F$ is the componentwise Laplacian of [[def-laplacian-of-a-c2-function]].",
          "uses": [
